  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hint: } \\cos ^2 \\phi+\\cos ^2(\\theta+\\phi)-2 \\cos \\theta \\cdot \\cos \\phi \\cos (\\theta+\\phi) \\\\\n& \\text { for } \\theta=0 \\\\\n& \\cos ^2 \\phi+\\cos ^2 \\phi-2 \\cos ^2 \\phi=0\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\text {which is independent from } \\phi \\text {. }$"
